  "owner": "Official atsd is the only ODU AT transport. All AK68 CLI reads forward to it. Original netifd WWAN/ODU retains PIN, SIM, APN, preinit, DHCPv4, DHCPv6 and delegated prefixes.",
  "adaptations": [
    "Keep official ELF library SONAME closure private; invoke current musl loader with --library-path instead of LD_LIBRARY_PATH.",
    "WWAN declares device:device and ifname independently of OEM feature config; add modern defaults and fallback UCI state functions.",
    "ODU dynamic children use current netifd device=@interface; zone lookup uses verified fw4 network command.",
    "Replace identity/cloud-coupled cellular_init and combo with ODU-only readiness lifecycle; no bdinfo/cloudd identity creation or OEM cloud startup.",
    "Replace logclient remote-capable ELF with local logger adapter.",
    "Mirror official infocd alias/model and cpesel.cur into existing AK68 cache selector and zero-based SIM selector, without running legacy dialer loops."
  ],
  "unresolved": [
    "Offline loader/symbol checks cannot establish all daemon/libubus protocol semantics or physical PoE/DHCP behavior; those need a separate explicitly authorized boot test.",
    "Legacy LED/Python UI process startup must be split from modeminit-AK68 by parent; legacy dialer/devck/atsd_tools remain disabled."
  ]
